###

# ============================================================================
# /deep/forward  &  /deep/reverse  –  Deep geocoding via Google Maps
#   Resolve via Google, map to OSM tags, index, return geocode/reverse-shaped.
#   Requires GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY + ENABLE_DEEP on the geocoder (else 503).
#   forward: q, language (required) · limit · region · publish · enrich
#   reverse: lat, lon, language (required) · publish · describe
#   Results carry category_key/category_value/category_group (same classifier as
#   /nearby), so a Google-resolved place is categorised immediately.
# ============================================================================

### Deep forward (English) – resolve a place via Google, index it
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/forward?q=Cairo Tower&language=en&region=eg&limit=5
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Deep forward without publishing (just resolve + return, don't index)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/forward?q=15 Tahrir Street, Cairo&language=en&publish=false
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Deep reverse – resolve an address for a point via Google
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/reverse?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&language=en
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

# ============================================================================
# /deep/nearby  –  Deep nearby search via Google Places API (New) Text Search
#   Queries Google, maps each place to OSM tags, publishes to NATS for indexing,
#   then returns nearby-shaped rows (distance_m + category).
#   lat/lon/language (required) · type OR keyword (required — it's the query)
#   radius m (a location BIAS, not a hard cut) · rankby=prominence|distance
#   limit (≤20/page) · cursor (scroll) · publish
#   Scroll: take pagination.next_cursor and pass it back as cursor for the next
#   page (it's Google's page token — keep the other params identical).
#   Freshly discovered places have address:null; /nearby enrichment fills it in.
#   Requires GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY + ENABLE_DEEP + "Places API (New)" enabled on
#   the Google Cloud project (else 502/503).
# ============================================================================

### Nearby restaurants near Tahrir (relevance-ranked), indexed + returned
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/nearby?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&radius=1000&type=restaurant&language=en
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Nearest-first cafes (rankby=distance)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/nearby?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&type=cafe&rankby=distance&language=en
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Keyword search, Arabic result names, preview only (publish=false)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/nearby?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&radius=2000&keyword=صيدلية&language=ar&publish=false
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Scroll page 1 — grab pagination.next_cursor from the response…
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/nearby?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&radius=1500&type=restaurant&language=en&limit=20
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### …then page 2 via the cursor (keep every other param identical). Replace <CURSOR>.
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/deep/nearby?lat=30.0444&lon=31.2357&radius=1500&type=restaurant&language=en&limit=20&cursor=<CURSOR>
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

# ============================================================================
# /describe  –  AI-generated title + description for a place
#   osm_id (required). First call blocks until generated, then cached.
# ============================================================================

### Describe a node (blocks until ready on first call)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/describe?osm_id=g_6bb77b635d2fd3eb
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

